  "notes": {
    "note-001": {
      "id": "note-001",
      "title": "Seminar 3 Discussion Notes with Mentor",
      "content": "# Meeting Notes: Prof. Sajal Mitra Review\nDate: October 2026\nLocation: HITK CSBS Department\n\n### Key Decisions\n1. **Separation of Responsibilities**:\n   - Random Forest for task prioritization based on objective features.\n   - NLP engine for extractive summarization of user documents and notes.\n   - Deterministic planner for schedule slot allocation.\n2. **Read-Only Scope**:\n   - No external writing to Google Calendar or Gmail in the prototype.\n3. **Continuous Learning**:\n   - Record completion records to refine model prediction accuracy over time.\n",
      "format": "markdown",
      "pinned": true,
      "tags": [
        "academic",
        "seminar",
        "hitk"
      ],
      "userId": "user-hitk-vinayak-001",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T08:16:54.935Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T08:16:54.935Z"
    },
    "note-002": {
      "id": "note-002",
      "title": "AI Workspace Architecture & Feature Ideas",
      "content": "# Architecture Ideas & Milestones\n\n- Front-End: React.js with Tailwind CSS for clean dark workspace UX.\n- Back-End: Node.js Express REST API server with ownership validation.\n- AI Layer: Python 3.14 Random Forest ML service and NLP summarizer.\n- Cloud: Firestore NoSQL database schema with real-time sync.\n\n### Next Steps:\n- Add drag-and-drop document upload with instant summary breakdown.\n- Verify Postman test suite across all CRUD endpoints.\n",
      "format": "markdown",
      "pinned": false,
      "tags": [
        "project",
        "architecture"
      ],
      "userId": "user-hitk-vinayak-001",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T08:16:54.936Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T08:16:54.936Z"
    }
  },
